00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.080
(laban kay Zeng Jie.)

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:39.600
(Noon yun)

00:12:40.399 --> 00:12:41.360
naging mamamatay tao ka.

00:12:42.559 --> 00:12:43.919
(Sa gabi ng apoy,)

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.480
(umalis ka ng maaga para magpahinga.)

00:12:45.679 --> 00:12:46.912
(Sabi mo uuwi ka na)

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:48.279
(ngunit pumunta sa ikatlong palapag.)

00:12:48.279 --> 00:12:50.039
(Akala ni Zeng Jie ay nag-hallucinate siya.)

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.000
(Ngunit wala siya.)

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:53.360
Pagkatapos ng party,

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:54.840
bumaba ka.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.039
(Alam mong lasing si Zeng Jie)

00:12:57.159 --> 00:12:58.879
(at tiyak na mananatili.)

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:00.720
(Kaya inilipat mo ang brazier)

00:13:00.919 --> 00:13:02.320
(sa tabi ng sofa.)

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.200
(Nang sumiklab ang apoy,)

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.120
(Si Zeng Jie ay nag-iisa sa studio.)

00:13:06.519 --> 00:13:07.759
Masyado siyang nainom

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.720
at madaling mamatay.

00:13:10.039 --> 00:13:11.080
Ngunit sa iyong pagtataka,

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:12.200
(kanyang lugar ng trabaho)

00:13:12.279 --> 00:13:13.919
(nag-organisa ng pagsasanay sa kaligtasan ng sunog)

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:14.799
(dalawang araw bago)

00:13:14.879 --> 00:13:16.559
(at binigyan siya ng emergency escape kit.)

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.399
Kaya't malapit na siyang nakatakas sa kamatayan.

00:13:20.399 --> 00:13:21.480
pagkatapos noon,

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:23.559
hindi ka na makahanap ng isa pang pagkakataon

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.039
para gumawa ng hakbang.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.440
(Ironically, ang apoy na ito)

00:13:27.639 --> 00:13:29.000
(ginamit para sa publisidad)

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.720
(at ginawang
master si Zeng Jie na muling ipinanganak mula sa abo.)

00:13:32.759 --> 00:13:33.960
Kung hiniwalayan mo siya

00:13:34.039 --> 00:13:34.919
kaagad,

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.600
Mawawalan ng pera si Zeng Jie

00:13:36.759 --> 00:13:38.279
ngunit may pangako pa rin

00:13:38.399 --> 00:13:39.399
at walang malasakit na kinabukasan.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.559
Hindi mo kinaya iyon.

00:13:42.399 --> 00:13:43.600
Kailangan niyang pumunta.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.519
Kaya ka nag-isip

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.639
isang pangmatagalang plano

00:13:48.279 --> 00:13:49.159
at tinulak si Zeng Jie

00:13:49.519 --> 00:13:51.320
hakbang-hakbang sa desperasyon.

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:52.960
Bai Xiaoling,

00:13:53.799 --> 00:13:54.919
kapansin-pansin ka talaga.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.120
Sige na.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.679
Hindi na ako makapaghintay na marinig ang iba.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.159
Makalipas ang isang buwan, naaksidente ka sa sasakyan.

00:14:05.679 --> 00:14:06.399
Mas tiyak,

00:14:06.519 --> 00:14:08.000
ito ay isang aksidente na hindi kailanman

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.159
totoong nangyari.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.159
Masusing nag-livestream ka pa

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.600
ang buong aksidente

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:13.320
(Munting Diwata)
(sa iyong kaibigan)

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:15.039
(sa pamamagitan ng telepono.)

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.159
Naaksidente ka

00:14:16.159 --> 00:14:17.519
mukhang kapani-paniwala.

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.720
(Bumangga ang sasakyan sa gilid ng kalsada)

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.159
(at nasugatan ka.)

00:14:23.159 --> 00:14:24.039
Ngunit sa katotohanan,

00:14:24.919 --> 00:14:26.080
ang iyong mga sugat ay

00:14:26.399 --> 00:14:27.360
sobrang menor de edad.

00:14:28.519 --> 00:14:29.559
Ang wheelchair ay totoo

00:14:30.519 --> 00:14:32.399
ngunit hindi ka may kapansanan.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.000
How I wish na tama ka.

00:14:37.799 --> 00:14:38.360
Sige.

00:14:39.639 --> 00:14:40.320
Hayaan akong magpaliwanag

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.240
aking kaltas.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.080
Kumuha ako ng used car

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.279
ulat ng pagtatasa.

00:14:46.799 --> 00:14:47.720
(Used Vehicle Appraisal)
Ang nasuri na kotse

00:14:47.919 --> 00:14:49.480
ay iyong sasakyan.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.039
Tingnan mo.

00:14:50.279 --> 00:14:51.879
Nabenta ito noong nakaraang taon

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.159
sa loob ng dalawang araw.

00:14:53.279 --> 00:14:55.200
Ang may-ari ay isang babaeng driver

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:56.480
na nagmaneho sa isang kanal.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.120
Tanging ang takip ng makina

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:59.360
at tsasis

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:00.399
may maliliit na gasgas.

00:15:00.559 --> 00:15:01.159
Ang sasakyan ay

00:15:01.279 --> 00:15:01.960
ayos na ayos.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.320
Napakababa ng presyo ng may-ari,

00:15:05.919 --> 00:15:06.679
malamang

00:15:06.759 --> 00:15:08.679
na-trauma sa aksidente.

00:15:09.559 --> 00:15:10.919
Ang preno ay hindi pinakialaman?

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:12.279
Ang preno?

00:15:12.799 --> 00:15:13.799
Syempre hindi.

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.159
Ang mga ito ay factory-orihinal.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.240
Under warranty pa.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:18.279
Sino ang nakakuha ng kotse dito?

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.720
Appraisal report lang yan.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.600
Baka nagkamali ako ng gas pedal

00:15:22.639 --> 00:15:23.600
para sa preno.

00:15:23.919 --> 00:15:24.559
Hindi pwede.

00:15:25.759 --> 00:15:26.879
Alam mo yun.

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:28.399
At ganoon din ako.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.200
Ang aksidenteng iyon ay hindi kailanman

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.240
disabled ka.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.720
(Isang buwan kang naospital,)

00:15:33.919 --> 00:15:34.879
(Spanning the New Year.)

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.000
(Binisita ka ni Zhang Ye,)

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:39.159
(kumbinsido na gusto ka ni Zeng Jie
na patayin ka.)

00:15:40.559 --> 00:15:41.320
Mahusay na kwento.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.159
Magpatuloy.

00:15:44.679 --> 00:15:45.360
pagkatapos noon,

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:46.840
naging simple ang buhay mo.

00:15:46.919 --> 00:15:47.480
syempre,

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.200
mababaw lang.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:51.399
(Halos tuwing hapon,)

00:15:51.399 --> 00:15:52.399
(nasa caf ka??,)

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.720
(pagbabasa sa QQ Reader,)

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.399
(at pumunta para mag-grocery.)

00:15:56.759 --> 00:15:58.600
(Ikaw ay isang magandang babae sa isang wheelchair.)

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.679
(Kaya ang mga mangangalakal)

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:00.960
(Mabilis kitang nakilala.)

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.440
(Alam nila na mahilig ka sa isda)

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:03.720
(at ang iyong asawa ay mahilig sa karne.)

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.759
(Akala nilang lahat ay optimistic ka)

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.039
(at nagmamalasakit.)

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:09.480
(Sa katotohanan, si Zeng Jie ay bihirang umuwi.)

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:10.879
Bumili ka pa ng karne

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:12.600
para lang mapanatili ang iyong imahe

00:16:12.799 --> 00:16:15.000
bilang isang may kapansanan, nakatuon sa pamilya,
at tapat na asawa

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.120
na nagmamahal sa kanyang asawa.

00:16:16.759 --> 00:16:17.360
(Ginawa mo sila)

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.519
(iyong mga saksi.)

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:19.840
(Kapag opinyon ng publiko)

00:16:19.879 --> 00:16:20.720
(ay kumukulo,)

00:16:20.919 --> 00:16:22.399
(nag-post sila at nag-repost ng mga komento)

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:23.919
(para suportahan ka.)

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:25.759
(pinakain mo)

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:27.559
(lahat ng karne)

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:28.799
(sa mga ligaw na pusa at aso.)

00:16:29.559 --> 00:16:30.120
Oo.

00:16:31.759 --> 00:16:32.559
Sinundan kita.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.240
Nagbabasa sa caf??s,

00:16:40.639 --> 00:16:41.559
pagkuha ng mga pamilihan,

00:16:41.759 --> 00:16:43.320
pagpapakain ng mga tira sa mga naliligaw.

00:16:43.919 --> 00:16:44.879
Ang daily routine ko

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:46.519
naging sabwatan?

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:53.879
(Anatomy)
Parang pamilyar?

00:16:55.879 --> 00:16:56.919
Ang mga ito ay

00:16:56.919 --> 00:16:57.879
na-save ang mga libro

00:16:57.879 --> 00:16:59.440
sa iyong e-reader.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:03.440
Siguradong nagkakamali ka.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:04.400
ako karamihan

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:05.839
magbasa ng mga nobela.

00:17:06.599 --> 00:17:08.240
Sa kasamaang palad, nawala ang aking mambabasa,

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:10.079
o ipapakita ko sa iyo.

00:17:10.359 --> 00:17:11.480
Huwag kang mag-alala.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.119
Umiiral pa rin ang iyong account.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.920
Kaya't mananatiling buo ang iyong mga na-save na tala.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:16.359
Malaking Hui.

00:17:17.039 --> 00:17:18.039
sinasabi mo ba

00:17:18.839 --> 00:17:20.160
pinaghihinalaan mo ako?

00:17:20.319 --> 00:17:20.839
Oo.

00:17:22.039 --> 00:17:23.839
At marami ka pang dapat marinig.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.160
Pagkatapos ma-discharge,

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:26.119
binili mo

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:27.960
anim na Damascus steel na kutsilyo sa loob ng anim na buwan.

00:17:28.359 --> 00:17:29.599
Ang sandata ng pagpatay

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:30.480
ay ang isa

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:31.440
kinuha mo sa bahay.

00:17:31.599 --> 00:17:32.200
syempre,

00:17:32.599 --> 00:17:34.200
matalino kang nag-claim noon pa man

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.319
na si Zeng Jie mismo ang nag-impake nito

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:37.799
at ginawa pang staff ng hotel

00:17:37.799 --> 00:17:38.839
iyong mga saksi.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.799
Bakit ka nakakuha ng napakaraming kutsilyo?

00:17:41.039 --> 00:17:42.880
Pinipili mo ang perpekto

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.640
habang nagsasanay ng mga galaw.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.880
Bumili din ako ng 12 steak knives

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.960
at dalawang full kitchen knife set.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.279
Ang kutsilyo ng prutas ay

00:17:50.279 --> 00:17:51.359
mas madaling dalhin.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:54.720
May katuturan.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.039
Kaya pinagsama-sama ang lahat ng ito,

00:17:57.519 --> 00:17:58.319
sa tingin mo

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.400
Pinag-isipan ko ang pagpatay kay Zeng Jie?

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.279
Tatlong buwan na ang nakalipas,

00:18:07.519 --> 00:18:09.039
Nakilala kita habang nag-iimbestiga

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:10.359
Zeng Jie.

00:18:10.799 --> 00:18:11.519
(Madalas ka)

00:18:11.559 --> 00:18:12.839
(Pumunta sa cafe na iyon.)

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.880
(Kaya nilapitan kita.)

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:16.759
alam ko.

00:18:17.119 --> 00:18:18.039
Medyo masakit

00:18:18.079 --> 00:18:19.000
kapag nalaman ko,

00:18:19.319 --> 00:18:21.599
pero pinatawad kita sa huli.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:22.319
Hindi.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:24.720
Bai Xiaoling.

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.440
Nakilala mo ako simula pa lang.

00:18:26.839 --> 00:18:27.440
Nalaman mo

00:18:27.519 --> 00:18:29.160
pagbanggit ko

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:31.039
ang Lohika sa Likod ng Katotohanan.

00:18:31.319 --> 00:18:33.640
Isa akong video content creator.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:34.920
Anong uri ng mga video?

00:18:35.119 --> 00:18:36.599
Pagsusuri ng misteryong kaso.

00:18:36.759 --> 00:18:38.519
Ang Lohika sa Likod ng Katotohanan.

00:18:40.599 --> 00:18:42.119
(Dahil matutulungan kita)

00:18:42.359 --> 00:18:44.160
alisan ng takip ang hindi mo magawa

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:45.599
madaling malaman ang tungkol kay Zeng Jie.

00:18:46.279 --> 00:18:47.920
Ang impormasyon tungkol kay Lin Fang

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:49.519
ay mahalaga.

00:18:50.279 --> 00:18:51.279
Anong nangyari

00:18:51.319 --> 00:18:52.319
kay Lin Fang maaari

00:18:52.359 --> 00:18:53.799
Wasakin si Zeng Jie.

00:18:54.359 --> 00:18:55.960
Kaya nahanap mo si Lin Shan

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.319
at ibinigay sa kanya

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:58.720
malaking halaga ng pera.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.480
Naniniwala akong tinanong mo siya

00:19:00.599 --> 00:19:01.839
para isuko ang sarili

00:19:01.839 --> 00:19:02.680
sa isang tiyak na punto

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:03.759
at tumambad kay Zeng Jie.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:05.400
sa totoo lang,

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:06.759
Lumapit ako kay Zhang Xiaohong,

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:08.359
umaasang mahikayat niya si Lin Shan.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.160
Pero tinanggihan niya ako.

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:11.640
Nagulat ako nang si Lin Shan

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:12.880
pinasok ang sarili.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:14.319
Pero nung nakita ko

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:16.079
abogado ng iyong ama,

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.480
nagkaroon ng kahulugan ang lahat.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.160
(Si Lin Shan noon)

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.400
(Healthcare Center)
(bahagi ng iyong plano.)

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.160
(Itong koneksyon)

00:19:22.279 --> 00:19:24.119
tinulungan akong malutas ang huling palaisipan.

00:19:24.559 --> 00:19:26.319
Noong pinatay mo si Zeng Jie sa hotel,

00:19:26.559 --> 00:19:27.960
dalawang beses ka rin nasaksak.

00:19:28.559 --> 00:19:30.039
Iniulat na nagmula ang mga sugat na iyon

00:19:30.039 --> 00:19:31.160
panlabas na puwersa.

00:19:31.319 --> 00:19:32.000
Ibig sabihin

00:19:32.039 --> 00:19:33.440
hindi mo sinaksak ang sarili mo.

00:19:33.799 --> 00:19:34.759
Kung ang aking mga kaltas

00:19:34.759 --> 00:19:35.799
ay tama,

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:37.359
mayroon ka

00:19:38.039 --> 00:19:39.279
isang kasabwat sa hotel.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:42.799
(Lobby lang)

00:19:42.799 --> 00:19:43.799
(may mga camera.)

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:44.880
(Hindi namin malaman)

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:46.160
(sino ang nasa kwarto mo.)

00:19:46.599 --> 00:19:47.400
Alam mo kung ano?

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:50.079
Nakuha ko ang lahat ng sibilyan

00:19:50.079 --> 00:19:52.039
surveillance footage sa malapit

00:19:52.839 --> 00:19:54.440
at sa wakas ay nakilala ang iyong ama.

00:19:57.359 --> 00:19:58.319
Naging maingat siya,

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:00.119
pagmamaneho ng hiniram na kotse,

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:02.279
ngunit nagkamali sa isang intersection.

00:20:03.039 --> 00:20:04.319
Tumingin siya sa labas.

00:20:09.759 --> 00:20:10.559
yun lang?

00:20:11.599 --> 00:20:12.359
Iyon lang.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.680
Mahusay na pagkukuwento.

00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:29.039
Hindi ito tungkol sa pagkukuwento.

00:20:30.079 --> 00:20:31.839
Ang iyong pagpaplano ay napakatalino.

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.640
Alam mo bang nakakapagod

00:20:35.519 --> 00:20:36.640
ito ay upang pag-aralan ang lahat ng ito?

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:26.839
Big Hui,

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.359
kahanga-hanga ka talaga.

00:21:29.799 --> 00:21:31.440
Nakuha mo halos lahat ng tama.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:40.720
Pero

00:21:41.559 --> 00:21:42.920
nagpresenta ka lang ng pagsusuri

00:21:43.559 --> 00:21:44.400
walang ebidensya.

00:21:46.279 --> 00:21:47.039
Nambobola mo ako.

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:49.759
baguhan lang ako.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.720
Purihin ang mga propesyonal.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:53.960
Pinaghihinalaan ka nila

00:21:54.039 --> 00:21:55.119
matagal na ang nakalipas,

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:57.839
at naglunsad ng buong pagsisiyasat.

00:21:58.279 --> 00:21:58.960
"Sila"?

00:21:59.079 --> 00:21:59.680
tama yan.

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:11.519
Bai Xiaoling,

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:13.440
ipasok mo ang iyong sarili.

00:22:21.119 --> 00:22:22.440
Sasakay ka ba sa wheelchair

00:22:22.839 --> 00:22:24.039
o maglakad gamit ang sarili mong mga paa?

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:44.519
Big Hui,

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:46.480
sayang naman.

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:49.160
Hindi ko natikman
ang kape na ginawa mo.

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:51.119
sa totoo lang,

00:22:52.759 --> 00:22:54.519
hindi ito ang gusto ko.

00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:01.039
Ngunit ito ay lampas sa pagbabago ngayon.

00:23:09.519 --> 00:23:10.680
Hindi, hindi.

00:23:13.559 --> 00:23:14.759
At gusto ko

